          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sai ya ce, \"Ina fa zan iya, in ba dai wani ya fassara mini ba?\" Saboda haka sai ya gayyaci Filibus yă hau yă zauna tare da shi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bābān yana karanta wannan Nassin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 8:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"An ja shi kamar tunkiya zuwa mayanka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 8:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuma kamar ɗan rago a hannun mai askin gashinsa yake shiru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 8:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "haka kuwa bai buɗe bakinsa ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A cikin wulaƙacinsa aka hana masa gaskiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 8:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wa zai iya yin zancen zuriyarsa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 8:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gama an ɗauke ransa daga duniya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sai bābān ya tambayi Filibus ya ce, \"Ka gaya mini, ina roƙonka, annabin yana magana a kan wane ne, kansa ne, ko kuwa wani dabam?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa'an nan Filibus ya fara da wannan Nassi ɗin ya kuma faɗa masa labari mai daɗi game da Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayinda suke cikin tafiya a kan hanya, sai suka iso wani wurin ruwa bābān nan ya ce, \"Duba, ga ruwa. Me zai hana a yi mini baftisma?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya kuwa ba da umarni a tsai da keken yaƙin. Sa'an nan da Filibus da bābān suka gangara zuwa cikin ruwan Filibus kuwa ya yi masa baftisma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa'ad da suka fita daga cikin ruwan, sai Ruhun Ubangiji ya fyauce Filibus, bābān kuwa bai ƙara ganinsa ba, amma ya ci gaba da tafiyarsa yana farin ciki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filibus kuwa ya fito a Azotus, ya yi ta zagawa, yana wa'azin bishara a dukan garuruwan sai da ya kai Kaisariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
